{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんにちは！\n新内眞衣です(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日めっちゃ暖かいですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽかぽかで気持ちいいのですが\n鼻がむずむず...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症持ちには\n辛い季節到来です(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、そうそう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のブログで、\nMV見たよとか\nLIVE当たるように祈っててとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私と同じように皆さんも\n喜んでくれていて本当に嬉しいです。\nコメント見ながらずっと\nニヤニヤしてたよー(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのMVでしたが、\n皆さん見つけられましたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さりげなく端っこの方とかに\nちょこっと映ってたりするので、\nウォーリーを探せ！的な要領で\n探して見て下さいね\\(//∇//)\\笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして！\nこないだ、\n初めて乃木どこの歌収録を\nして来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラを意識するのが\n難しかったのですが、\nとっても楽しかったです(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当すぐ気が抜けた顔を\nしちゃう癖、治したいな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もまた、何回も\nチェックしながら撮り直しして\nもらいました(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フォーメーションの移動が\n多い振り付けだし、\n歌割もあるから\n少しでも映ってたらいいな（´-`）.｡oO"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"O.A.の日がわかったら\nまたお知らせしますので、\n良かったら探して下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、この日は\n待ち時間が長くて暇だったので\nみさ先輩に遊んで貰いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインを書きながら\nちょっかい出してくる\nみさ先輩が可愛いすぎる問題。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日情報解禁になりましたが、\n楽天カード会員の方限定の\nアンダーLIVEをさせて頂くことに\nなりました(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは、\nhttp://www.rakuten-card.co.jp/smart/campaign/rakutencard/140314/\nに載っています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽天の会社にロケも行って\n来たので、映像も含めて\n是非チェックしてみて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、\n今日はこの辺でおしまいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/03/15/6409287/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."}],"source":"archive"}